sequenceDiagram
    title Sequence 1/2: Select skills and read data
    participant user
    participant gateway
    participant runtime
    participant jev
    participant model
    participant mcp
    user->>gateway: Summarize pending POs as Excel
    gateway->>gateway: Check tenant/scopes/budget
    gateway->>runtime: Request with trusted context
    runtime->>runtime: Resolve release + metadata
    runtime->>jev: Allowed skill/model choices
    jev-->>runtime: Selected IDs or clarification
    runtime->>runtime: Validate IDs; load skill version
    runtime->>mcp: Check tool/schema; read POs
    mcp-->>runtime: Verified data, rows and sources
    runtime->>model: If prose needed: skill + data
    model-->>runtime: Draft for schema/fact validation
    runtime->>runtime: Persist job, then queue
    runtime-->>gateway: Table + queued job ID
    gateway-->>user: Show results; track the job
